    "Light signal", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "9f4ee081-075e-44db-bb6c-39fc963fe623"], Cell["\<\
A light ray from an event of one inertial worldline meets a second worldline \
at exactly one event, later on its clock for a later emission.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d6905898-2325-4e13-8ea0-3dc814c7953b"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "0551537a-b613-4b18-bd9d-aecc890f380d"], Cell[
    "EPS", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "aee3ec62-53a3-4e29-8ea7-c6e759cf9c80"], Cell[
    "Message function", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "be62efee-b8f3-4cb0-ba91-b4f9f9ca38f3"], Cell[TextData[{
     "The map from a particle ",
     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
     " to a particle ",
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"],
     " that sends an event of ",
     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
     " to the event of ",
     StyleBox["Q", "TI"],
     " reached by a light signal from it; with the echo it defines radar \
coordinates."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"96f7ab4a-52a6-4dd4-973c-666699b88bb5"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"57a36d96-894b-4c7a-8dfd-\
c23901f2c830"]
}, Open  ]],

